  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94f0839ca0cf8be85940149ff2d5a97d855722a26e4b2f1b78c452f6e22e2499",
      "text": "报道国内度假设施的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60028011d50c313c8dc4ae6dc3972bd3af44a5c9800bb447e515bcad0b519f0c",
      "text": "这次请类先生报道的，\n是一处国内的度假设施。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabf6063888c28b5c2ed494a788aedd0de5245a9d757e81927e0b1cc347916f5",
      "text": "那里有可以打高尔夫、骑马、\n玩拓展运动和打网球的设施，老少皆宜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec167e0e6ec8d7e0923ecbd51833336f8b50db2304e97ea71c30c789cad54fc4",
      "text": "这么说来……类先生学生时代\n参加过网球社团对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4461d587469d0e7076d4aa4560859a59a7130913bd3bd2dd3fa05d7abb3715c7",
      "text": "Of course！我跟北斗也是在网球社团\n认识的呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:947c5cb61493014b7dab613569ab90e3ebd2006825472306483ab69b1883eddb",
      "text": "那是个很随性的社团，very fun哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c59d9724a7e869516d8c8d03ef2daff270730ad471a2dddeb14e482c739a49",
      "text": "呵呵，原来是这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f512055576961c0d1518ae95d6cce77bd340bbd9293f7d5e03da4af8da952b",
      "text": "对方还特意交代，要是看到感兴趣的设施，\n请务必好好体验游玩一番呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa2f60755e73149bc1eea7fcfbfaf5f184db4f1a4a1c834a045aa377dad66da",
      "text": "Really？既然这样，\n要不要一起打网球？其他的也可以哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da9797d9b30078dcbb894b770e92a6337b8487c915cd72f0ee524c57a96e5ba4",
      "text": "我觉得只要跟●●●●プロデューサー酱一起，\n玩什么都会很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_03:1_5_036_03:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d023f607b5a39109194ab14eb892bcc7a4318616f1c9857b7aa7f4531f425fc",
      "text": "……哎呀，聊着聊着好像已经到现场了。\n至于玩什么，等work结束之后再定吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
